{
  "info": {
    "name": "health-cron-bun",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Health-check relay service for the [Snow Monkeys](https://github.com/snow-monkeys-org) stack.\n\n**Repository:** [snow-monkeys-org/snow-cron-bun](https://github.com/snow-monkeys-org/snow-cron-bun)\n\n**API endpoints (7):**\n1. `POST /queue` — register or update a probe in `livenessprobe_records_{profileId}`\n2. `GET /queue` — list probes for a profile (`actorId` + `gitType` query params)\n3. `GET /profiles` — list all profiles with nested probe records\n4. `POST /delete-record-from-queue` — remove a probe from the main active queue\n5. `GET /failed-records` — list failed probes (`livenessprobe_failed_records`)\n6. `GET /deleted-records` — list deleted probes (`livenessprobe_deleted_records`)\n7. `GET /health` — service liveness\n\n**JSON format:** all request and response fields use **camelCase** (`snowName`, `healthUrl`, `actorId`, `gitType`, etc.).\n\n**Profile flow:** `POST /queue` and `GET /queue` resolve `livenessprobe_profiles` by `actorId` + `gitType`, then read/write `livenessprobe_records_{profileId}`. Probes registered only in profile tables are **not** polled by the cron until they exist in main `livenessprobe_records`.\n\n**Cron (every 10 min):** reads main `livenessprobe_records` only; GET each `healthUrl`, POST result to `snowHostUrl` (default `http://snow-monkeys.com:8080`).\n\n**Collection variables:** `baseUrl`, `snowName`, `healthUrl`, `snowHostUrl`, `actorId`, `gitType`\n\n**baseUrl:** `http://localhost:3000` for `bun run dev`. Use `http://localhost:4202` when running via Docker Compose."
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "snowName",
      "value": "my-service",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "healthUrl",
      "value": "https://my-service.example.com/health",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "snowHostUrl",
      "value": "http://snow-monkeys.com:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "actorId",
      "value": "12345",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "gitType",
      "value": "github",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
