            "description": "Returns probes from `connectors.livenessprobe_records_{profileId}` for the profile matching `actorId` + `gitType`.\n\n**Required query params:** `actorId`, `gitType`\n\n| Status | Meaning |\n|--------|---------|\n| `200` | Probes returned (may be empty) |\n| `404` | Profile not found |\n| `422` | Missing query parameters |"
          },
