            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/failed-records",
            "description": "Returns all rows from `connectors.livenessprobe_failed_records`, ordered by most recent failure first.\n\nProbes appear here after more than 10 consecutive network failures on `healthUrl`.\n\n**Response `200`:**\n```json\n{\n  \"records\": [\n    {\n      \"snowName\": \"my-service\",\n      \"healthUrl\": \"https://my-service.example.com/health\",\n      \"snowHostUrl\": \"http://snow-monkeys.com:8080\",\n      \"failureCount\": 11,\n      \"lastError\": \"Unable to connect\",\n      \"failedAt\": \"2026-07-13T22:30:00.000Z\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-13T22:00:00.000Z\",\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-07-13T22:30:00.000Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total\": 1\n}\n```"
